        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-12-06T12:32:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can’t answer the second, but for the first a supplement is likely to contain a mixture of pre built characters, addtional character creation options (Prime Wardens has been hinted to have Void specific magic stuff and host stuff), villains, canon locations and plot elements, and sample adventures, (Not all supplements may contain all this stuff)</p>",
